{"title":"Decorative Picks","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"collection-description__heading section-title h2\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eDecorative Christmas Picks for Layered Holiday Styling\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eShop Christmas tree picks from Carol's Christmas Conifers to add texture, depth, and decorative detail to your holiday décor. Designed to complement your \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eartificial Christmas tree\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, wreaths, and garlands, decorative picks are an easy way to enhance your overall design and create a fuller, more refined look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur collection includes a range of styles, from classic berry and pine accents to metallic and leaf-inspired designs, making it easy to coordinate with both traditional and modern holiday décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eTypes of Christmas Tree Picks\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSugar Berry Picks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBright red berries with natural variation add a classic pop of color, perfect for trees, mantels, or tabletop displays.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBerry and Pine Picks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA mix of pine branches and red berries creates a traditional, cozy holiday look ideal for wreaths, garlands, or centerpieces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSilver Burst Picks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMetallic branches with a subtle shimmer add a modern, decorative touch and work well across a variety of holiday styles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSilver Berry Picks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBerry clusters with a metallic finish offer a polished look that blends easily with both classic and contemporary décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRose Gold Leaf Picks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLeaf-shaped accents in a warm metallic tone bring a refined, elevated feel to trees, wreaths, and seasonal arrangements.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eEach set includes multiple picks, making it easy to style and layer throughout your décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat are Christmas tree picks?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eChristmas tree picks are decorative accents designed to be placed within the branches of a tree, wreath, or garland to add visual interest and dimension. They’re commonly used to fill gaps, enhance fullness, and introduce additional color or texture into your display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow do you use decorative picks on a Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePlace picks throughout your \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/full-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Full Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003efull\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/slim-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Slim Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eslim\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, or \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/sparse-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Sparse Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003esparse\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e artificial Christmas tree to create depth and a layered effect. Position them near the outer branches to highlight key areas, or tuck them deeper within the tree to build fullness.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFor a cohesive look, choose styles that complement your ornaments, ribbon, and overall color palette. Mixing finishes such as matte, metallic, and textured elements helps create a more dynamic display. We have also seen Carol's Christmas Conifers tree picks, styled in a vase as a complimentary holiday look that fits in cohesively \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhere else can you use Christmas picks?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIn addition to Christmas trees, decorative picks can be used to enhance wreaths, garlands, and tabletop arrangements. Their versatility makes them an easy way to carry your design throughout your home. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eFor an added decorative touch, Carol's Christmas Conifers picks can also be arranged in a vase to complement your holiday décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eComplete your holiday season décor with Christmas tree picks from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Whether you're styling a tree, wreath, or garland, these versatile accents help add depth, texture, and a polished finishing touch to your displays.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"sugar-berry-picks","title":"Sugar Berry Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAdding a splash of color to your holiday oasis is easy with a set of our faux Sugar Berry Picks. Studded with\n\u003cbr\u003ered berries and featuring slight variations from branch to branch, these picks are the perfect accent for your\n\u003cbr\u003emantel, tabletop display, or anywhere else you need a touch of genuine seasonal ambiance. 12 picks are\n\u003cbr\u003eincluded for endless possibilities!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42332383117512,"sku":"PK12-SUGB","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/RedWhiteBerryTree-2.jpg?v=1722012823"},{"product_id":"silver-burst-picks","title":"Silver Burst Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eSometimes you don’t know you need something\n\u003cbr\u003euntil you see it, like an elegant set of Silver Burst\n\u003cbr\u003ePicks. With a sparkling beauty that will bring joy to\n\u003cbr\u003eyou and your guests for years to come, these picks\n\u003cbr\u003eare the holiday accent that can fit in virtually\n\u003cbr\u003eanywhere. Infuse your holiday decorations with a\n\u003cbr\u003esparkling burst of silvery holiday magic.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Silver Burst Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037579976,"sku":"EDS6Y5T","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverBurstPicks_12Pack.png?v=1722013727"},{"product_id":"golden-berry-picks","title":"Silver Berry Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMake the most of your holiday setting by layering\n\u003cbr\u003ein some festive Golden Berry Picks. Perfectly sized\n\u003cbr\u003eto fit almost anywhere, these elegant picks feature\n\u003cbr\u003edetailed branches of gold-sprayed berries as a\n\u003cbr\u003esignature highlight. Add that final touch to your\n\u003cbr\u003eoasis with these cheerful decorations as you feel\n\u003cbr\u003ethe joy of the season and create memories that will\n\u003cbr\u003elast a lifetime.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Golden Berry Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037612744,"sku":"VAG9S8V","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverBerryPicks_12Pack_7006c7d5-5650-4b5e-ac71-429019b0ba69.png?v=1722013720"},{"product_id":"berry-pine-picks","title":"Berry and Pine Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the beauty of the holiday season to any room\n\u003cbr\u003ewith festive Berry and Pine Picks! These elegantly\n\u003cbr\u003ecrafted accents are highlighted by festive red\n\u003cbr\u003eberries and beautiful pine branches, creating a\n\u003cbr\u003etraditional and homey holiday atmosphere that\n\u003cbr\u003eradiates unmatched feelings of comfort and joy.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Berry and Pine Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946038005960,"sku":"TSX8P7B","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BerryandPinePicks_12Pack_bdb6921a-6fa0-4e05-8782-8488df80d70b.png?v=1714662133"},{"product_id":"gold-leaf-picks","title":"Rosegold Leaf Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCreate a beautiful, timeless holiday scene with a\n\u003cbr\u003eset of Gold Leaf Picks. These meticulously crafted\n\u003cbr\u003eholiday picks truly capture the spirit of the season\n\u003cbr\u003ewith their bold and beautiful golden leaves.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re decorating for your annual\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas party or just adding a touch of holiday\n\u003cbr\u003echeer to your home, these elegantly detailed picks\n\u003cbr\u003ebring an inviting spirit of tradition to your holiday\n\u003cbr\u003eoasis.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Gold Leaf Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946038038728,"sku":"DFJ2W4G","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingOfChristmas2025_BrookePavelPhoto012.jpg?v=1765555967"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/KOC2022Berries-Revised1.jpg?v=1750877755","url":"/\/collections\/picks.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}